{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankfeest is the literal Dutch translation of couch party. This game is meant to be played with friends, either physically on the couch or by screen sharing the game with your friends.<br>This game contains several minigames, which can be selected from the main menu. Players can get in on the fun by joining through their phones.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856250?t=1751999430","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3856250?t=1751999430","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856250/4b3cbc24155e8edcd913b16623d078ba7c74ec6f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1751999430","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3856250/4b3cbc24155e8edcd913b16623d078ba7c74ec6f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1751999430","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game itself contains no mature content. However, it does show what the players within the session post. There is a chat function in the lobby and for the Hangman game, anyone can type anything."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bankfeest is the literal Dutch translation of couch party. This game is meant to be played with friends, either physically on the couch or by screen sharing the game with your friends.<br>This game contains several minigames, which can be se